            regions: "Uttar Pradesh, Bihar, Rajasthan, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Jharkhand, Uttarakhand, Himachal Pradesh, Haryana, Punjab, Delhi, J&K, Ladakh, Odisha",
            desc: "The lunar month ends on Purnima (Full Moon). In this tradition, the dark fortnight (Krishna Paksha) begins the month. Followed across North, Central, and Eastern India for major festivals and fasts."
